  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Out integrated and Multi-sectoral Eco-regional Approach in Bale Eco-region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action is a follow up phase of the project titled &apos;&apos;Conservation of Biodiversity and Ecosystems Functions and improved well-being of Highland and Lowland Communities within Bale Eco region, FED/2014/343843.). The Specific objective is to sustainably manage the ecosystems and watersheds of the Bale Eco-region and improve the livelihoods of highland and lowland communities in the same eco-region&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
